  "description": "# 🎗 Mystic Alliance\nEST. September 4, 24\n\n🏆 **Founders guild** | Top 50 since January 1, 25 | Lv. 100 since May 12, 25 \n## Who are we?\n \nMystic Alliance is a community-driven guild group, dedicated to exploring the vast expanse of **[IdleMMO]**. Our members are passionate players who value teamwork, strategy, and camaraderie. We strive to create a welcoming environment for players of all skill levels, fostering growth and collaboration.  \n\n## 📅 Activities\nUTC+0/24h format\n\n- Assault (8h) - Every Thu/Fri/Sat | 11:00\n\n- Energizing pool - Every Thu/Fri/Sat | 10:00\n\n- The Silent Watchers (Raid) - Every Sun/Mon/Tue/Wed | 11:00\n\n## 🔆 Requirements\n- 🔔 Active participation in assaults/raids and challenges\n- 💬 Respectful communication and behaviour\n\nIf you do not match the requirements, check out our trainings guild **Mystic Wayfarer**\n\n## 🎁 Benefits\n- 🤖 World boss notification bot\n- 🗂️ Collection of resources\n- 🔧 Forging and Alchemy services\n- 🎁 Giveaways (Tools, Gear, Mats, Membership,...)\n- 🪙 Public market with lower prices\n\n## 🏛 Guilds\n- Mystic Vanguard\n- Mystic Crusader\n- Mystic Dawn [Skiller]\n- Mystic Wayfarer [Trainer]\n- Mystic Abyss [Cursed]\n\n## ⭕️ Application via Discord\n#### https://discord.gg/Ndz4eNPECy\n\nVisit the server, enter the queue and\n# ❇️ JOIN US NOW",
